   "title": "Cord or root? Motor exam + the LOWEST sensory level",
   "lines": [
    "UMN = CORD: tone ↑, reflexes ↑, upgoing toe",
    "LMN = ROOT: wasting, tone ↓, reflexes ↓",
    "COMPLETE = nothing below the level, incl. rectal tone"
   ]
  },
