   "title": "Cord causes: not just trauma or tumour",
   "items": [
    "vascular: stroke, AVM, fistula · infectious: epidural abscess, viral, syphilis (tabes dorsalis)",
    "trauma: fracture, stab, disc, radiation · autoimmune: lupus · metabolic: B12 (subacute combined degeneration)",
    "inflammatory: multiple sclerosis · also: transverse myelitis, syrinx · neoplastic: metastatic, extradural, intrinsic",
    "congenital: achondroplasia · degenerative: disc herniation, arthritis, motor neuron disease (ALS)"
   ],
